WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.260
What does home mean to you?

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.460
Being in Mossville?

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.580
Home is . . .

4
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.060
It’s going to be really missed.

5
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:08.700
It is.

6
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.620
Yes, it is.

7
00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.580
It’s missed when we even left here.

8
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:16.080
Because like we left part of our life here.

9
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.200
And that’s part that we couldn't take with us to Lake Charles.

10
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.820
And it’s something you have to get used to it.

11
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:27.420
You know, when you’re . . . I just said in the country like, out here like it was,

12
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:32.380
and you’re moving into a city that you never knew nothing about before, it’s completely different.

13
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.160
Yeah.

14
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:37.820
Because it’s a lot of things you can do out here in the country, you can’t do in the city and stuff.

15
00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:41.760
We have to get used to all this stuff.

16
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.028
And the community is not like the same like being here.

17
00:00:44.028 --> 00:00:46.640
The community’s not like even, it’s completely different.

18
00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:48.820
And as years go, it’s getting worse and worse.

19
00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.720
You know, things are not like it used to be.

20
00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:56.940
Like I say, I just pray and ask God for things to come back and be better than what it is now.

21
00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.860
Who knows?

22
00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:00.340
Families helping families.

23
00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:00.860
That’s the best.

24
00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.840
They don’t help families no more.

25
00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.420
That was the best time.

26
00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.080
Sit around the fire.

27
00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:07.820
Yep.

28
00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:09.100
Listen to the old stories.

29
00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.300
Listen to the old people talking Creole.

30
00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.300
Dancing Zydeco.

31
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:13.500
Dancing Zydeco.
